<mxCell id="note12" value="&lt;b&gt;What actually changes vs SaaS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;• Only the billing/procurement channel moves to AWS Marketplace&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;• Inference still runs on Anthropic infrastructure - identical setup, capabilities, controls&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;• No data residency change, no gateway, no network architecture change&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#7F6000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;size=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="40" width="620" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
